# Description of this project and its data. pyglotaran only checks that this file
# exists; every export contains a copy. All fields are optional.
title: Getting started with pyglotaran
description: >
  Global analysis of a simulated sequential decay with three species, for the getting
  started guide of pyglotaran.
data_description: >
  Simulated time-resolved spectra from glotaran.testing.simulated_data: 2100 time points
  from -1 to 20, 72 wavelengths from 600 to 699.4 nm, Gaussian instrument response,
  normally distributed noise with standard deviation 0.01.
creators:
  - name: The pyglotaran developers
keywords: [global analysis, getting started]
